            "body": "I bisected the issue and it seems there are **2 issues** in reality:\n\n1. In commit 1f6db306c4134a8cd8cba4225a2b19c56acbf705 the code started producing compilation error:\n   ```\n   Error compiling Cython file:\n   ------------------------------------------------------------\n   ...\n   from typing import Final\n   \n   LIMIT: Final[int] = 128\n   ^\n   ------------------------------------------------------------\n   finalmod.py:3:0: 'LIMIT' redeclared\n   ```\n2. Later in commit 3ee3f71606b4db347bcd204e9e4a851953699fdb the crash was introduced.",
